Fonts used by the display (third_party/fonts/ and the generated gfx/fonts/nunito_*.h)

Nunito Sans, Copyright 2016 The Nunito Sans Project Authors
(https://github.com/Fonthausen/NunitoSans). Licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1,
full text in OFL-NunitoSans.txt.

- nunito-sans/NunitoSans-Regular.ttf, NunitoSans-SemiBold.ttf, NunitoSans-Bold.ttf are static
  instances cut from the variable font (wght 400, 600, 700; wdth 100; opsz 12; YTLC 500). The
  instances are derived works under the OFL; they do not use a Reserved Font Name.
- gfx/fonts/nunito_*.h are generated from those files by tools/bake_font.cpp (glyph alpha
  tables). They are derived works too and carry the same licence.
